            "code": "<div style=\"text-align: left;\">\n    <p>We are thrilled to announce our sponsorship of the National Dog Show, a prestigious event celebrating the incredible bond between humans and their canine companions. At Oneisall, we believe that every dog is a champion in the eyes of its owner, deserving of recognition and love. Through this event, we aim to highlight that each pup is a winner and deserves the best care possible.</p>\n    <p>Oneisall is dedicated to providing a champion-level grooming experience for every dog, ensuring they look and feel their best. Join us in celebrating our furry friends and the joy they bring to our lives!</p>\n</div>"
